  <h1>1. Executive Summary & Architecture Overview</h1>
  <p>CLOSETÉ was built to independently satisfy all five assigned academic programming exercises while delivering a luxury fashion brand experience with an editorial monochrome aesthetic (#0A0A0A, #F7F6F2, #FFFFFF, #292929, #D8D8D5).</p>

