  <h1>2. Program 1: Browser-Based Online Fashion Shopping Interface</h1>
  <h3>Aim:</h3>
  <p>To develop a browser-based fashion shopping interface using HTML5, modern CSS3, and vanilla JavaScript (ES6+), demonstrating DOM manipulation, event handling, product search, multi-faceted filtering, regex validation, and asynchronous Fetch API GET and POST methods.</p>

  <h3>Execution Command:</h3>
  <pre>node Program_1_Vanilla_JS/server.js
# Access in browser at: http://localhost:5000</pre>

  <h3>Terminal Execution & Verification Output:</h3>
  <pre>[TEST 1] GET /api/products -> 200 OK (Catalog Count: 17 items)
[TEST 2] POST /api/products -> 201 Created (Created ID: closete-0763)
[TEST 3] POST Validation Error -> 400 Bad Request ("name, price, and category required")
[TEST 4] Static HTML Serving -> 200 OK
✓ ALL PROGRAM 1 TESTS PASSED (100%)</pre>

