  <h1>4. Program 3: Node.js Inventory Utility (Zero Express)</h1>
  <h3>Aim:</h3>
  <p>To implement a fashion inventory management utility using only Node.js core built-in modules (http, fs, path, events, stream), strictly avoiding Express or third-party web frameworks.</p>

  <h3>Execution Command:</h3>
  <pre>node Program_3_Node_HTTP/server.js
# Access in browser at: http://localhost:5001</pre>

  <h3>Verification & Audit Stream Output:</h3>
